{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50832","headline":"汤泉 · 缪岛云","name":"汤泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖泛朱砂石壁幽，轩皇曾浴上丹丘。\n阴阳相煮连珠浦，今古长煎泻镜流。\n紫气晓笼烟色澹，锦霞明照火光浮。\n何方爲洗身轻後，便跨飞龙到十洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}